18
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:36,900
The competition is based on Bittensor as a subnet.

19
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:39,200
Competitors

20
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:43,833
submit a thousand paths or Monte Carlo simulations.

21
00:01:43,833 --> 00:01:48,733
Every hour on a continuous basis and are scored on

22
00:01:48,733 --> 00:01:53,633
how accurate their distributions are to the actual price.

23
00:01:53,633 --> 00:01:55,766
So it's live, it's ongoing.

