00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:44,933
Yeah, so we use continuous rank probability scoring system.

70
00:05:44,933 --> 00:05:47,400
So you're continuously ranked on

71
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:52,400
how close your distributions are to the actual price movement.

72
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:55,000
And this rewards people who are confident

73
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,600
