78
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:11,166
And the subnet is weighted to people who have

79
00:06:11,166 --> 00:06:12,833
accurate predictions.

80
00:06:12,833 --> 00:06:15,366
Accurate forecasts of distributions.

81
00:06:15,366 --> 00:06:16,733
